0846dcdf: .;
.;Main entry point for editing an existing VISIT ENTRY subfile (#393.01).
.;The SUBFILE DD contains a WORD-PROCESSING field which allows the
.;creation of very large text nodes.
.;
.;If a valid existing Subfile entry is passed, then the SUBFILE DD will
.;call this routine.
.;
.;On exit, a successful edit will file the edited text in the 
.;Subfile Multiple, as well as allow cross-references defined in the
.;SUBFILE DD to execute.
.;
